DOMAIN|__PROJECT_DIR_DOMAIN__|Domain (without www., redirects to www.)
SITE_TITLE|__DOMAIN_STEM__|Site title
SITE_DESCRIPTION||One-line description
AUTHOR||Author name
FEDI_PROFILE||Fediverse profile URL (empty for none)
FEDI_HANDLE|@__DOMAIN_STEM__@__DOMAIN__|Fediverse handle shown under the title
FEDI_FEED|__FEDI_PROFILE__/feed.rss|Fediverse RSS feed URL (Mastodon uses profile URL + .rss)
NAMESPACE|__DOMAIN_SLUG__|Kubernetes namespace
IMAGE|git.int.m11s.de/slaxor/__DOMAIN_SLUG__:latest|Container image
CLUSTER_ISSUER|letsencrypt-prod|cert-manager ClusterIssuer
